      "post": {
        "summary": "Deadline Alerts",
        "description": "Send one alert per open case as it enters each deadline bucket (48 h, 24 h, 6 h).\n\nCall it on a schedule (Zapier Schedule, cron). Repeated calls do not repeat\nan alert: each case alerts once per bucket, recorded in its action log.",
